Package: conceptR
Title: Concept Lifecycle, Evaluation, Audit and Drift Governance
Version: 0.2.1
Description: Versioned, scoped concept definitions evaluated as SQL expressions
    against ontology object types. Concepts are hypotheses: they can be drafted,
    activated, deprecated, staged, and compared. Includes audit sampling, reviewer
    judgments, drift detection, governance logging, RBAC, and promotion gates.
    Absorbs the auditR package - no separate auditR dependency required.
Depends: R (>= 3.6)
Imports:
    DBI,
    jsonlite,
    cli,
    ontologySpecR (>= 0.2.2)
Suggests:
    duckdb,
    RSQLite,
    zoo,
    actionTypesR,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Remotes:
    CathalByrneGit/ontologySpecR,
    CathalByrneGit/actionTypesR
